OL,3,CWorld backgammon tournaments to be
OL,4,Cheld in UK for first time
OL,6,FThree of the world's biggest
OL,7,Fbackgammon tournaments come to London
OL,8,Fin the summer.
OL,10,FThe World Team, the World Women's Team
OL,11,Fand the World Individual champions
OL,12,Fwill be held at the Mercure Hotel at
OL,13,FEarl's Court from August 24-30.
OL,15,FIt's the first time that the UK has
OL,16,Fhosted these events and it will be the
OL,17,Fbiggest backgammon event ever to be
OL,18,Fheld in the country.
