OL,3,CWorld backgammon tournaments to be
OL,4,Cheld in UK for first time
OL,6,FScores of players and teams from
OL,7,Facross the world will compete for the
OL,8,Fchampionships which have been
OL,9,Forganised by the World Backgammon
OL,10,FFederation (WBGF) and the UK
OL,11,FBackgammon Federation (UKBGF),
OL,12,Fsponsored by Mind Sports Olympiad and
OL,13,FPlay Strategy.
OL,15,FBackgammon is one of the oldest games
OL,16,Fto be played, dating back thousands of
OL,17,Fyears. It's a game of strategy and
OL,18,Fluck ` as players move chequers around
OL,19,Fa board determined by the roll of dice.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/4
