OL,3,CWorld backgammon tournaments to be
OL,4,Cheld in UK for first time
OL,6,FWBGF president Bernhard Mayr said:
OL,7,F"We're delighted that our flagship
OL,8,Fevents are being held in London in the
OL,9,Fsummer. The UK is one of the strongest
OL,10,Fbackgammon nations in the world and
OL,11,FI'm sure this event will be a huge
OL,12,Fsuccess.
OL,14,FUKBGF chair Julia Hayward added: "It's
OL,15,Fa real honour for the UK to have been
OL,16,Fchosen to host these championships,
OL,17,Fwith the best players in the world
OL,18,Fexpected to take part.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@bOU
