OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786272502
OL,3,CWorld backgammon tournaments to be
OL,4,Cheld in UK for first time
OL,6,F"Backgammon is booming in the UK at
OL,7,Fthe moment, with new players starting
OL,8,Fto play and new clubs being set up. We
OL,9,Fhope this event will give added
OL,10,Fmomentum to interest in the game."
